Overlay patch 0020: quit = confirm dialog, then CVarSave + exit(0).

Part 1 (rev1, reference SYNC WAVE 1 mandatory fix 3): the menu's power
button calls Window->Close(), which on desktop unwinds the main loop; on
iOS there is no loop to unwind to and the Ship of Harkinian port measured a frozen
screen. Save config and exit cleanly.

Part 2 (rev2, device feedback 2026-07-23): the red power button sits in
the top-right cluster right beside Reset, and it quit INSTANTLY — one
stray tap (easy on a touch screen) killed the app and any unsaved
progress. Every sibling port asks first. Now it opens a confirmation
modal; only its "Quit" button performs the close/exit, "Cancel" dismisses.
Uses the port's own ImGui BeginPopupModal pattern (as in Tools.cpp's
ConfirmDeleteAllPopup) — SoH's SohGui::mModalWindow/RegisterPopup
infrastructure does not exist in this port. Both the button and the popup
live in the same ID scope (immediately adjacent in Menu::DrawElement), so
OpenPopup/BeginPopupModal pair correctly.

The whole quit-button body is owned by THIS patch, so the confirmation
lands here as a revision rather than a later patch editing 0020's text
(a later patch mutating an earlier patch's installed lines breaks that
patch's applied-state probe in apply-overlay.sh).

--- a/src/port/ui/Menu.cpp
+++ b/src/port/ui/Menu.cpp
@@ -697,10 +697,36 @@
     options3.size = UIWidgets::Sizes::Inline;
     options3.tooltip = "Quit";
     if (UIWidgets::Button(ICON_FA_POWER_OFF, options3)) {
-        if (!popped) {
-            ToggleVisibility();
+        // SOH_IOS (overlay 0020 rev2): never quit on the raw tap — the red
+        // power button is one stray touch away from killing the app (it
+        // sits beside Reset in the top-right cluster). Ask first.
+        ImGui::OpenPopup("Quit Spaghetti Kart");
+    }
+    {
+        ImVec2 sohQuitCenter = ImGui::GetMainViewport()->GetCenter();
+        ImGui::SetNextWindowPos(sohQuitCenter, ImGuiCond_Appearing, ImVec2(0.5f, 0.5f));
+        if (ImGui::BeginPopupModal("Quit Spaghetti Kart", nullptr, ImGuiWindowFlags_AlwaysAutoResize)) {
+            ImGui::TextUnformatted("Are you sure you want to quit Spaghetti Kart?");
+            ImGui::Separator();
+            if (ImGui::Button("Quit", ImVec2(140, 0))) {
+                ImGui::CloseCurrentPopup();
+                if (!popped) {
+                    ToggleVisibility();
+                }
+                Ship::Context::GetInstance()->GetWindow()->Close();
+#ifdef __IOS__
+                // no desktop main loop to unwind to; Close() alone left a
+                // frozen screen on device (reference fix 3).
+                CVarSave();
+                exit(0);
+#endif
+            }
+            ImGui::SameLine();
+            if (ImGui::Button("Cancel", ImVec2(140, 0))) {
+                ImGui::CloseCurrentPopup();
+            }
+            ImGui::EndPopup();
         }
-        Ship::Context::GetInstance()->GetWindow()->Close();
     }
     ImGui::PopStyleVar();
 
